xtensionDependencyGenerator#Release_Notes", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Changes/GnomeShellExtensionDependencyGenerator - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://pagure.io/packaging-committee/pull-request/1425", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "PR#1425: WIP: add guidelines for GNOME Shell extensions - packaging-committee - Pagure.io", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/ELFQVE2CLJKPFUMFYWUQR5SR6PNF7GQI/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "F42 Change Proposal: GNOME Shell extension Dependency Generator (system-wide) - devel-announce - Fedora mailing-lists", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/GnomeShellExtensionDependencyGenerator#How_To_Test", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Changes/GnomeShellExtensionDependencyGenerator - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/program_management/changes_policy/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Changes policy :: Fedora Docs", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/GnomeShellExtensionDependencyGenerator#Detailed_Description", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Changes/GnomeShellExtensionDependencyGenerator - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/User:Salimma", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "User:Salimma - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": "Proven Packager", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "group_moderator": true, "user_id": 157, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": "Ownership transferred", "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [{"status": {"description": "Fedora Change Wrangler", "emoji": "speech_balloon", "ends_at": null, "message_bus_last_id": 1}, "id": 1663, "username": "amoloney", "name": "Aoife Moloney", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/amoloney/{size}/1725_2.png"}], "post_url": "/t/f42-change-proposal-gnome-shell-extension-dependency-generator-system-wide/140618/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 369211, "name": "system", "username": "system", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/system/{size}/2604_2.png", "created_at": "2024-12-24T15:10:55.342Z", "cooked": "<h2><a name=\"p-369211-how-do-you-feel-about-the-proposal-as-written-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-369211-how-do-you-feel-about-the-proposal-as-written-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>How do you feel about the proposal as written?</h2>\n<div class=\"poll\" data-poll-charttype=\"bar\" data-poll-name=\"poll\" data-poll-results=\"always\" data-poll-status=\"open\" data-poll-type=\"regular\">\n<div class=\"poll-container\">\n<ul>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"ba0977c9bba7dc9ca757f991ba8b4898\">Strongly in favor</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"89d4638b183fab74dc1ebfb6b6eca338\">In favor, with reservations</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"2d91e8a605ec011cd3bfb19209c9552b\">Neutral</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"dcfc0af2b792b627d76e888bd360d6b3\">Opposed, but could be convinced</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"caa92de9d781dd44e9c7b891bed9bf5c\">Strongly opposed</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"poll-info\">\n<div class=\"poll-info_counts\">\n<div class=\"poll-info_counts-count\">\n<span class=\"info-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"info-label\">voters</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>If you are in favor but have reservations, or are opposed but something could change your mind, please explain in a reply.</p>\n<p>We want everyone to be heard, but many posts repeating the same thing actually makes that harder. If you have something new to say, please say it. If, instead, you find someone has already covered what you’d like to express, please simply give that post a <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/heart.png?v=15\" title=\":heart:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":heart:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> instead of reiterating. You can even do this by email, by replying with the heart emoji or just “+1”. This will make long topics easier to follow.</p>\n<p><strong>Please note that this is an advisory “straw poll” meant to gauge sentiment. It isn’t a vote or a scientific survey.</strong>  See <a href=\"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/about-the-change-proposals-category/82650\" class=\"inline-onebox\">About the Change Proposals category</a> for more about the Change Process and moderation policy.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 4, "updated_at": "2024-12-24T15:10:55.342Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 1, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 35, "readers_count": 34, "score": 7.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 140618, "topic_slug": "f42-change-proposal-gnome-shell-extension-dependency-generator-system-wide", "display_username": "system", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/about-the-change-proposals-category/82650", "internal": true, "reflection": false, "title": "About the Change Proposals category", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 157, "username": "salimma", "name": "Michel Lind", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.o